# Keep the API image build context small and free of secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/reports
**/.turbo
.pnpm-store
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
docs
# The mobile app is not part of the API image, but its package.json must stay: the workspace
# lockfile lists it, and pnpm install --frozen-lockfile checks every workspace manifest.
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
